{"answer":"Call 911 now. 
Ribs pulling in with each breath, or blue lips or face, means call 911.
 Fast breathing alongside those signs is serious. Stay with your child and unlock the door for the paramedics.","triage":"Call 911 now. Do not wait to see if it passes, and do not call 811 first, because 811 is not for this. Go straight to the ER only if you cannot get an ambulance. Tell them: fast breathing, ribs pulling in, blue lips."}
